flowchart TB
  CODE[Implemented in code] --> UNIT[Unit/static tests]
  UNIT --> PG[Validated on disposable PostgreSQL]
  PG --> GIT[Pushed to GitHub]
  GIT --> CI[To industrialize in CI]
  CI --> STAGE[To validate in staging]
  STAGE --> PROD[To deploy in production]
  PROD --> EVID[Operational evidence]
  EVID --> CLAIM[Enterprise claim only if all gates closed]
